{"id":"a987285ba9cb0966","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms.md","title":"Theorem — 几何态射的复合","display":"Theorem — 几何态射的复合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms","aliases":["14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms"],"display":"Theorem — 几何态射的复合","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 几何态射的复合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(g:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射。</li>\n<li>本书原子运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\diamond f\">\\(g\\diamond f\\)</span> 的参数顺序按下式固定；它代表通常书写的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ g\">\\(f\\circ g\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g\\diamond f:=(g^*\\circ f^*,f_*\\circ g_*),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(g\\diamond f,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g\\diamond f:=(g^*\\circ f^*,f_*\\circ g_*),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(g\\diamond f,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：伴随复合给出 g<em>f</em>⊣f_<em>g_</em>，有限极限保持对函子复合封闭。参数顺序显式固定，以便 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38f60858c822a22c\" href=\"?note=38f60858c822a22c\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-surjection-embedding-factorization\">14-thm-geometric-surjection-embedding-factorization</a>的分解不再反向。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$、$g:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-geometric-surjection-embedding-factorization","status":"resolved","id":"38f60858c822a22c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明：伴随复合给出 g*f*⊣f_*g_*，有限极限保持对函子复合封闭。参数顺序显式固定，以便 [[14-thm-geometric-surjection-embedding-factorization]]的分解不再反向。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"g\\diamond f","display":false},{"tex":"f\\circ g","display":false},{"tex":"g\\diamond f:=(g^*\\circ f^*,f_*\\circ g_*),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(g\\diamond f,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":943,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms|Theorem — 几何态射的复合]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms|Theorem — 几何态射的复合]]"},{"id":"34f27739c5ea48f5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38f60858c822a22c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为几何态射；$f\\cong h$ 指 [[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]] 的同一几何态射范畴中的对象同构，采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]] 的可逆箭头条件；满射、嵌入、复合分别见 [[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]、[[14-df-geometric-embedding]]、[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]。"}],"outgoing":["9752b779c5f463f9","d2b4e5cf16585f95","38f60858c822a22c"]}